      "counted_items": "Carry unit_label instead (burritos, quarts, bags, pans).",
      "low": "An item is low when on_hand is at or below par. Low is figured live, never stored. A blank (null) par means Chow Hall has not learned the line yet -- it asks Kalea once when the item comes up, then remembers.",
